    "title": "Three Transformer model families",
    "description": "Encoder-only Transformers use bidirectional self-attention, encoder-decoder Transformers combine a bidirectional encoder with a causal decoder that cross-attends to encoder output, and decoder-only Transformers use causal self-attention. Typical objectives and model examples are shown."
